// t61: `global` must proxy the ROOT (::) namespace, not be a namespace of
// its own.
//
// builtin/io.aardio opens with `self.io = global.io;`. If `global` were a
// plain table, that read would yield null and wipe the io namespace; the
// remaining `import builtin.*` statements of builtin/_.aardio then stop
// silently, ::RECT is never defined, and gdi / win.ui fail with
// "运行错误: 尝试调用非函数值 (.RECT)".
io.print("str:" .. type(global.string));
io.print("io:" .. type(global.io));

// writes through `global` land in the root namespace
global.marker = 123;
io.print("set:" .. tostring(marker));
io.print("get:" .. tostring(global.marker));
